WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
There is a tiny movement you may never notice.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Hang a soft weight from a thread. Imagine it swinging. Sometimes it does.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
In 1976, researchers showed attention and physical support changed the pendulum's motion.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
That does not prove an audio product delivers an hour of meditation in twelve minutes.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before you buy a promise, ask what the actual evidence tests.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
And if you only need twelve minutes of quiet, begin with those. For free.
